{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>俄羅斯莫斯科大學一名中國留學生在課堂上，披上日本軍國主義旗幟，校方指已展開調查。內地官媒批評為軍國主義張目，是公然冒犯人類良知。</p><p></p><p>網上圖片見到，這名中國留學生身披象徵日本軍國主義的旭日旗，旁邊還放有一頂二戰時期的日軍軍帽。事發在上周三，他正在莫斯科大學上歷史堂，據報他的行為引發其他中國留學生不滿，雙方一度爆發言語及肢體衝突，最終涉事學生拍片道歉。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.STUDENT 1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260Aj70TTg3X1792403831.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>莫斯科大學中國留學生陳同學說：「各位中國同學，對於昨天的事，首先我作出誠摯的道歉，是對祖國和人民的不尊重。」</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.STUDENT 1830_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Cqkq6TRRKb1792403888.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>其他同學向學校反映事件，校方指已啟動調查，並認定這名中國留學生行為違背學校育人理念，擾亂校園教學秩序，將於近期發布處理結果。</p><p></p><p>內地《解放軍報》旗下新媒體「鈞正平」發表評論，指事件令人震驚及憤慨，指相關旗幟是日本軍國主義侵略歷史的標誌性符號，任何為軍國主義張目的行為，都是對人類良知的公然冒犯。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.STUDENT 1830_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026OI3tJKnvmN1792403852.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.STUDENT 1830_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FS3ClB5w151792403869.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T10:59:06.023462+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":376,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T11:57:44.397692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:57:01.568517+00:00","content_hash":"17b2690526de686371790036c3af94b4d04260acd8ce7533bade1d3b9810579a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}